arm_modes.description:
**Areas** (parts of the system you arm separately, usually just one): {areas}
**Zones:** {zones}

**'Away'** always arms the whole alarm. Your installer may also have set up **part arms**, which leave some zones off: for example, Part Arm 1 at night, so you can move around upstairs while downstairs is armed.

Choose the part arm behind **'Night'** and **'Home'**, or *'Not used'* to hide that button.

Unsure? Ask your installer, check which zones each part arm leaves off in Wintex, or see [part arms explained]({help}).
